{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">今日（10日）網絡流傳一段車Cam片段，雖然不是發生車禍但引發大批網民熱烈討論與轉發。事件發生於銅鑼灣街頭，一架白色私家車在右轉時向左同時切線，事後停在路中心落車，更疑似持有剪刀利器指罵片主。 </span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">根據網傳影片，事發時，片主正駕車駛經銅鑼灣一帶。在駛過銅鑼灣邊寧頓街轉右入怡和街，交通燈位後的轉彎位置，前方一輛白色私家車突然向左切線。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"dafb6c5d-e5cc-4530-86ec-9d98f5ad6f54.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026uuyh8jlp8o1789023566.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"dafb6c5d-e5cc-4530-86ec-9d98f5ad6f54.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\"> 圖片：車cam L（香港群組）Facebook</span>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b38f6325-1cd6-4f5a-8b24-a8897e456701.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026UOTvalXmPP1789023566.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b38f6325-1cd6-4f5a-8b24-a8897e456701.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\"> 圖片：車cam L（香港群組）Facebook</span>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3d22a13c-eb69-452d-aa78-b1c0547ff573.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026ZKr64sq9SO1789023566.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3d22a13c-eb69-452d-aa78-b1c0547ff573.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\"> 圖片：車cam L（香港群組）Facebook</span>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">片主見狀隨即響號怒斥：「乜嘢呀你」。白色私家車司機疑不甘被響號，把車停在中線上，並怒氣沖沖地衝出車廂。最令人震驚的是，該名司機手上疑似持有剪刀，並指向片主指罵：「你再指！我剪你，最多我坐監！」雙方過程中用互相粗口指罵，片主指：「我有Cam」白色車司機便返回私家車。</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7aeabfea-8f11-4c91-9734-11e32997c9d7.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026bnCyyUlqwh1789023566.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7aeabfea-8f11-4c91-9734-11e32997c9d7.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\"> 圖片：車cam L（香港群組）Facebook</span>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"8230240d-0b2e-4fe6-bd1b-c9f01cc9451d.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026i1Djszp66B1789023565.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"8230240d-0b2e-4fe6-bd1b-c9f01cc9451d.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\"> 圖片：車cam L（香港群組）Facebook</span>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">Facebook 這段影片曝光後，白色車司機的失控行為令不少網民感到嘩然。若在公眾地方手持剪刀等利器並作出指嚇，有可能觸犯法例。 不少網民留言：「應該即時報警」、「1823 啦」、「嘈贏咗又點」。</span><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-10T07:20:22.156393+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":517,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}